Model\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/ab45d51bb8f2.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/69531d314031.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image18176aaa78fde63fb\" src=\"/media/219b50337b94.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nBilingual design considerations\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nA major consideration was the bilingual requirements of the site. It needed to look good with both English or Chinese characters. Therefore, while designing we layed out two versions of the site in tandem to ensure this was well considered throughout the design process.  <br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"pre